{"reviews":[{"id":"B083LYH94D-0","r":5.0,"t":"One of the best curing lamps UV and LED","x":"This is one of the better curing lamps.  It is both UV and LED and works on both hands and feet (fingernails and toenails).  Everything fits wit room to spare as it is not too cramped.  It is of the same level of quality as those used in professional nail salons.  I love it!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-1","r":2.0,"t":"Not as fast as stated","x":"I don't know if I'm doing it right, or what is going on. I got this machine because of the power. I've been sitting here for 10 minutes and my polish is still sticky. I have them in there for the max time that they go and I have to do it several times.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-2","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s not working","x":"This is a fraud. I\u2019m pretty sure all these 5 stars reviews were written by friends or family. It doesn\u2019t work for me. I need a refund","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-3","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s not working","x":"This is a fraud. I\u2019m pretty sure all these 5 stars reviews were written by friends or family. It doesn\u2019t work for me. I need a refund","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-4","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s not working","x":"This is a fraud. I\u2019m pretty sure all these 5 stars reviews were written by friends or family. It doesn\u2019t work for me. I need a refund","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-5","r":1.0,"t":"item did not work for me","x":"less than an hour after opening and i\u2019ve already requested a return label and off to the ups store it goes. i\u2019m hoping for the return process to go smoothly. * please excuse my dry ass cuticles.... the pictures i posted are from my nails being under the curing light for a little under 5 minutes and as you can see, it didn\u2019t completely dry my nails and that sucks because obviously that\u2019s what i wanted.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-6","r":5.0,"t":"Good Purchase","x":"Works as described, adjustable timer settings. Must purchase.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-7","r":1.0,"t":"Trash and poor packaging","x":"Box came unsealed and beaten up. There was lamp (unworking, I tried it with my old cord from a different lamp) There was no manual and no cord. Trash.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-8","r":1.0,"t":"Died after a month","x":"It worked well at first. But after a month or so of use the light when out. The display lights when plugged in but lamp light is not functioning. A waste of money. It was barely used and should not stop working.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-9","r":5.0,"t":"Works.","x":"Works great for sculpting gel. I\u2019ve done my own nail since the start of quarantine. With continue to do so. Thank you.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-10","r":2.0,"t":"Does not work for gel nails","x":"Doesn't work....finally used this and even after 10mins with my nails in this thing, they still weren't dry :(","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-11","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste $$","x":"Did not dry polish after trying 10 minutes on each hand","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-12","r":5.0,"t":"Powerful! Very effective!","x":"Works perfect! It is so easy to use! I was definitely skeptical since I've only ever gone to a salon to get a gel manicure and spent a lot money. The cost of the this UV/LED Nail dryer is less than what I pay to get a gel manicure at a salon. And now I can do it from home. In less than 1 minute each layer dried. is less than getting a gel manicure at the salon. but once I used it and saw how easy it was to use and how quick my nails driedy. Be sure to use gel nail polish that needs to be cured r","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-13","r":5.0,"t":"Lightweight and Functional LED Lamp","x":"I have a few customers at home. So, I\u2019ve used for them and so far seems to be very good. The pack included the main LED Lamp and charger and a very small booklet. It cures fast and easy to use. The bottom part can be separated to cure toes. In general, worths the money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great Lamp","x":"This gel nail lamp works great! Super fast dry. Does get a little cramped if you do two hands at a time, but just insert one hand while doing the other and switch off. Definitely recommend!","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-15","r":2.0,"t":"Less than 10x used for $30?!","x":"Horrible quality. Product just stops working out of the blue with no product damage while sitting on the shelf. Waste of money and overpriced!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-16","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy, broke after 5 uses.","x":"Broken in two months, shorts out in 51 seconds IF I can get it to work at all. I've used it now 5 whole times.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-17","r":5.0,"t":"really nice nail light","x":"The only thing I have not found was the off switch so I just unplug it.  It really is a great item.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-18","r":4.0,"t":"It\u2019s great but would be better if had a fan","x":"I love it. Doesn\u2019t have a fan. I wish it did.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-19","r":5.0,"t":"Cures so quick!!","x":"Okay so first off I wana say I don't usually do reviews on products but I thought maybe this will help someone make a decision quick as it took me a whole week clicking around to choose this lamp! Lol so, I bought this for myself & my teenage daughter to use for our gel polish & it works great! It's got the digital display timer, cords a little on the shorter side but for me not a big deal. This cures all my gel polish & rhinestone gel glue perfectly. I always cure my base coat, color & top coat","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-20","r":5.0,"t":"Very functional and easy to use","x":"This nail lamp is still very good. Its appearance is very good. It is a style I like, and I think its workmanship is very delicate and it is very durable. When I use it, I think it is very good. I can put my hands inside. It heats my nails very well. For people like me who love nail art, this is a very good product. I like it very much. Recommend buying","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-21","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to bake","x":"Very good, easy to operate, easy to dry, hurry up and get one, you can do all kinds of manicures, it is not too beautiful. Similar to the ones used in nail salons. The speed of the fairy baking lamp is too fast, the nail polish will dry in tens of seconds. The point is that the speed is fast enough to avoid black hands","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-22","r":1.0,"t":"After 5 months light stops turning on. USELESS","x":"[[VIDEOID:c1f7dc9451fdfe20353c31ee7a6cf3ac]] SAVE YOUR MONEY!!! So sad, after 5 months of probably using it like 6 times overall, the uv light stopped working. I read im not the only one, several people have had this issue. Very disappointed on seller. Whats the point of it lasting only 6 months.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-23","r":5.0,"t":"Can fix the gel well","x":"You can make nails at home in the future. 42 upgraded UV and LED beads can quickly cure the gel, but will not harm your eyes or dark skin; you don\u2019t have to worry about side collisions or mess up the polish; the bottom can also be removed from the top, Easy to clean and disinfect.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B083LYH94D-24","r":1.0,"t":"BE CAREFUL PURCHASING THIS PRODUCT","x":"I have use this led lamp product a total of 5x...went to use it again and I can not. The product will not come on. The numbers show but lamp will not work. I have had this product less than 6mos. So disappointed. Be very careful when purchasing this product\ud83e\uddd0","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the lamp does not cure or dry polish even after extended time, calling it ineffective.","cites":[2,3,4,5,6,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the unit stopped working or arrived non-functional, including one that died after a month.","cites":[3,4,5,6,8,9]},{"text":"Positive reviewers praise it as fast, powerful, and easy to use, comparable to salon quality.","cites":[1,7,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note it works for both hands and feet, with a detachable bottom for toenails.","cites":[1,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention cramped space when doing two hands at once.","cites":[1,15]}]},"qa":[]}